WEBVTT

00:03:27.745 --> 00:03:30.081
Year two and three
are your lab development years

00:03:30.122 --> 00:03:34.210
where you learn the pedagogy,
classroom management,

00:03:34.252 --> 00:03:36.170
shadowing teachers, lesson planning,

00:03:36.212 --> 00:03:38.089
things of that nature.

00:03:38.130 --> 00:03:42.009
It all culminates
in placement into the classroom.

00:03:42.843 --> 00:03:45.221
But the really special sauce
of our program

00:03:45.263 --> 00:03:48.140
is our internal, personal
and professional development,

00:03:48.182 --> 00:03:49.433
the Cipher series.

00:03:50.184 --> 00:03:54.855
The Cipher series is where young men
get a chance to break down and dissect,

00:03:54.855 --> 00:03:57.692
sort of recalibrate
their compasses, if you will,

00:03:57.692 --> 00:04:00.444
in regards to being a Black man
in this world today,